# Briefing: Review Rust changes — "safely"

**Stack:** Rust

## Constraints

### Hard (Non-negotiable)

<rules priority="required">
- NEVER: touch `unsafe` blocks
- When working in `src/ui/**`: MUST: WCAG 2.1 AA
</rules>

### Soft (Preferred)

<rules priority="preferred">
- PREFER: small diffs
</rules>

### Ask First (Requires approval)

<rules priority="ask-first">
- STOP and confirm with the user before: Adding a dependency
</rules>

## Sacred Regions (Do Not Modify)

The following files and directories must not be modified under any circumstances. If a task requires changes to these paths, STOP and report the conflict.

<protected_files>
- `src/auth/**` — security reviewed
</protected_files>

